    {
      "id": "u_8171e79b1dbcea07101316e5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Traefik 3.6.4 introduced a __TRILIUM_PH_0__breaking change__TRILIUM_PH_1__ regarding how percent-encoded characters are handled in URLs. Trilium puts the title of an image or attachment in its URL path, so one whose title contains __TRILIUM_PH_2__ or __TRILIUM_PH_3__ is requested at a path such as __TRILIUM_PH_4__. Traefik rejects these paths with HTTP 400, and the image does not load. Search is not affected, because it sends its text in a query parameter.",
      "sourceHash": "8171e79b1dbcea07101316e5755bde3e5973408a7d1943e647bc85e9715f98a4",
      "context": "Traefik > Breaking change in Traefik 3.6.4",
      "contextHash": "97a03cce822cf9a826624ebbc47e0c9f5ff2954491d60c97e1c04545b0d6dd0f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Traefik 3.6.4では、URL内のパーセントエンコードされた文字の処理方法に関して __TRILIUM_PH_0__破壊的変更__TRILIUM_PH_1__ が導入されました。Triliumは画像や添付ファイルのタイトルをそのURLパスに含めるため、タイトルに __TRILIUM_PH_2__ または __TRILIUM_PH_3__ を含むものは __TRILIUM_PH_4__ のようなパスでリクエストされます。TraefikはこれらのパスをHTTP 400で拒否するため、画像が読み込まれません。検索はクエリパラメータでテキストを送信するため、影響を受けません。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7405eba904096dcb53973406_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The easiest solution is to update to Traefik 3.6.7 or later which reverts this configuration change. Alternatively, the configuration can be changed according to the section below.",
      "sourceHash": "7405eba904096dcb53973406cbc2de932e7b3c3ec669e0063a480375c1755dd9",
      "context": "Traefik > Breaking change in Traefik 3.6.4",
      "contextHash": "97a03cce822cf9a826624ebbc47e0c9f5ff2954491d60c97e1c04545b0d6dd0f",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "最も簡単な解決策は、この設定変更を元に戻すTraefik 3.6.7以降にアップデートすることです。または、以下のセクションに従って設定を変更することもできます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
